    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu anyaga Naboti uruzabibu rwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hariho umugabo witwaga Naboti w'i Yezerēli, yari afite uruzabibu i Yezerēli hafi y'ibwami kwa Ahabu umwami w'i Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu abwira Naboti ati “Mpa uruzabibu rwawe, kugira ngo ndugire igihambo cy'imboga kuko ari hafi y'urugo rwanjye, nzaguhe urundi ruzabibu rururuta ubwiza, cyangwa washaka naguha ibiguzi byarwo ku ifeza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboti abwira Ahabu ati “Biragatsindwa n'Uwiteka kuguha gakondo ya ba sogokuruza banjye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Ahabu ataha afite agahinda n'uburakari, ku bw'ijambo Naboti w'i Yezerēli yamubwiye ngo “Sinaguha gakondo ya ba sogokuruza banjye.” Nuko aryama ku gisasiro cye yerekeye ivure, yanga kugira icyo afungura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma umugore we Yezebeli araza aramubaza ati “Ni iki kiguteye agahinda kikakubuza kurya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we aramusubiza ati “Ni uko navuganye na Naboti w'i Yezerēli nkamubwira nti ‘Mpa uruzabibu rwawe turugure ifeza, cyangwa washaka naguha urundi mu cyimbo cyarwo.’ Na we akansubiza ati ‘Sinaguha uruzabibu rwanjye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umugore we Yezebeli aramubwira ati “Dorere, ntutegeka ubwami bwa Isirayeli? Byuka ufungure ushire agahinda. Ni jye uzaguha urwo ruzabibu rwa Naboti w'i Yezerēli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aherako yandika inzandiko mu izina rya Ahabu azifatanisha ikimenyetso cye, azoherereza abatware n'impura bo mu murwa we n'abaturanyi ba Naboti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yandika muri izo nzandiko ngo “Nimutegeke abantu biyirize ubusa maze mushyire Naboti imbere yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbere ye muhashyire abagabo babiri b'ibigoryi bamushinje bati ‘Watutse Imana n'umwami.’ Nuko muhereko mumujyane, mujye kumutera amabuye mumwice.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko abatware bo mu murwa n'ab'impfra b'abanyarurembo babigenza uko Yezebeli yabatumyeho, nk'uko yanditse muri izo nzandiko yaboherereje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bategeka abantu kwiyiriza ubusa, bashyira Naboti imbere yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze abagabo babiri b'ibigoryi barinjira bamwicara imbere. Abo bagabo b'ibigoryi bashinja Naboti bari imbere y'abantu bati “Naboti yatutse Imana n'umwami.” Uwo mwanya baramusumira bamuvana mu murwa, bamutera amabuye arapfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baherako batuma kuri Yezebeli ko Naboti bamuteye amabuye bakamwica.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yezebeli yumvise ko Naboti bamuteye amabuye agapfa, abwira Ahabu ati “Haguruka wende rwa ruzabibu Naboti w'i Yezerēli yangaga ko mugura, ntakiriho yapfuye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu yumvise ko Naboti yapfuye arahaguruka, aramanuka ajya muri urwo ruzabibu rwa Naboti w'i Yezerēli kuruzungura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya atumwa kuvuma Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubwo ijambo ry'Uwiteka rigera kuri Eliya w'i Tishubi riti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Haguruka umanuke usange Ahabu umwami w'Abisirayeli utuye i Samariya, ubu ari mu ruzabibu rwa Naboti yagiye kuruzungura, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abami 22.38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " umubwire uti ‘Uwiteka aravuze ngo: Ni uko urishe urazunguye?’ Maze umubwire uti ‘Umva uko Uwiteka avuga: Aho imbwa zarigatiye amaraso ya Naboti, ni ho zizarigatira n'ayawe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu abwira Eliya ati “Urambonye ga wa mwanzi wanjye we?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na we ati “Ndakubonye koko, kuko wiguriye gukora ibyangwa n'Uwiteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Umva nzakuzanira ibyago ngutsembe rwose, nzamara umuhungu wese kuri Ahabu, uw'imbata n'uw'umudendezo mu Bisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzahindura inzu yawe nk'iya Yerobowamu mwene Nebati, kandi nk'iya Bāsha mwene Ahiya, kuko wandakaje ukoshya Abisirayeli ngo bacumure.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
